  "description": "Looking for a font that’s as fun and energetic as a skate park on a Saturday afternoon? Meet Skates Bounce, a playful graffiti font designed to bring a dose of street-style charm to your projects.\nThis font is all about good vibes and creative freedom. Its bold, bouncy characters look like they were tagged with a marker, giving your designs a genuine, hand-crafted feel. But here’s the best part: it comes with an extruded layered font. This means you can easily create awesome 3D effects with layered colors, making your typography pop off the screen.\nWhether you’re crafting a new brand for a kids’ toy store, designing a poster for a street art festival, or just want to add a quirky touch to your social media graphics, Skates Bounce is your new go-to. It’s perfect for anything that needs a rebellious, youthful spirit. Get ready to roll out some serious style and watch your designs come alive with this incredibly fun and versatile font.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Looking for a font that’s as fun and energetic as a skate park on a Saturday afternoon? Meet Skates Bounce, a playful graffiti font designed to bring a dose of street-style charm to your projects.</p>\n<p>This font is all about good vibes and creative freedom. Its bold, bouncy characters look like they were tagged with a marker, giving your designs a genuine, hand-crafted feel. But here’s the best part: it comes with an extruded layered font. This means you can easily create awesome 3D effects with layered colors, making your typography pop off the screen.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re crafting a new brand for a kids’ toy store, designing a poster for a street art festival, or just want to add a quirky touch to your social media graphics, Skates Bounce is your new go-to. It’s perfect for anything that needs a rebellious, youthful spirit. Get ready to roll out some serious style and watch your designs come alive with this incredibly fun and versatile font.</p>",
